# Forum (P11, premium — Cairo bought it) — demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
#
# One-time local setup (Development) is the same as users.http. Decision D4: every thread and reply shows the author's
# name, rank and department — there is no anonymous posting.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@adminToken = paste-the-admin-token-here
@studentToken = paste-a-students-token-here
@professorToken = paste-a-professors-token-here
@facultyId = paste-a-faculty-id-here
@categoryId = paste-a-category-id-here
@threadId = paste-a-thread-id-here
@postId = paste-a-post-id-here
@reportId = paste-a-report-id-here

### Student Affairs: a university-wide category (facultyId null) …
POST {{host}}/api/admin/forum/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "General", "nameAr": "عام", "facultyId": null, "sortOrder": 0 }

### … or one faculty's
POST {{host}}/api/admin/forum/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Engineering", "nameAr": "الهندسة", "facultyId": "{{facultyId}}", "sortOrder": 1 }

### Members: the categories they can use
GET {{host}}/api/forum/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Start a thread (optionally about a subject: its teachers may then pin/lock it); 10 posts a minute max (429)
POST {{host}}/api/forum/categories/{{categoryId}}/threads
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Study group for CS301", "body": "Who is in?", "subjectId": null }

### Threads of a category: pinned first, then latest activity
GET {{host}}/api/forum/categories/{{categoryId}}/threads?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Open a thread with its replies (opening it as the author re-arms the reply notification)
GET {{host}}/api/forum/threads/{{threadId}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Reply (locked thread → 409); the thread's author is notified once until they open it
POST {{host}}/api/forum/threads/{{threadId}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Negative edges break Dijkstra — use Bellman-Ford." }

### Edit / delete your own reply within 15 minutes (Student Affairs any time)
PUT {{host}}/api/forum/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Negative edges break Dijkstra; Bellman-Ford handles them." }

### Moderate: pin / lock (Student Affairs, or a teacher of the thread's subject)
POST {{host}}/api/forum/threads/{{threadId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "locked": true }

### Report one thread or one post
POST {{host}}/api/forum/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "postId": "{{postId}}", "reason": "Spam" }

### Student Affairs: the open reports, then remove the content or dismiss
GET {{host}}/api/admin/forum/reports?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/forum/reports/{{reportId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "remove" }
